Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; The default wallpaper, merged into an existing system hive when a package is upgraded from a release that had none
; (a fresh hive gets it from system.reg). A user's own choice under HKCU overrides it.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\Software\Vde\Desktop]
"Wallpaper"="/usr/share/backgrounds/vde/Vibe.png"
"WallpaperMode"="Fill"
